# fossify-math 1.4.0 (F-Droid, Java only, no network): 7 + 5 = changes the display. Positions read at 1440x900 content; display region = the result rows above the keypad.
size 1440 900
control break-input
wait-stable 0 0 1440 900 20000 1000
expect-varied 0 64 1440 296
# the first input of the run redraws the whole picture in another palette: one harmless tap on the display first, so the mark is taken after it
tap 720 200
wait-stable 0 0 1440 900 5000 1000
mark display 0 64 1440 296
tap 144 434
wait-stable 0 64 1440 296 5000 500
tap 1008 834
wait-stable 0 64 1440 296 5000 500
tap 432 568
wait-stable 0 64 1440 296 5000 500
tap 720 834
wait-stable 0 64 1440 296 10000 1000
expect-changed display
expect-varied 0 64 1440 296
